{
  "slug": "cascade",
  "name": "Cascade",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-native coordination for multi-service development. Orchestrates cross-cutting changes across microservices with dependency-aware propagation, automatic contract sync, and cross-service verification.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **5 agents**, **2 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `contract-management` (Use when working with API contracts in a multi-service project), `cross-service-verification` (Use when verifying that a cross-service change was applied correctly), `multi-service-orchestration` (Use when a change request affects multiple services or needs cross-service coordination)\n- **Agents** (5): `cascade-contracts` (Updates shared API contracts and dependency map to match actual service implementations), `cascade-planner` (Creates detailed implementation plans for cross-service changes), `cascade-verifier` (Verifies cross-service consistency after changes), `cascade-worker` (Implements code changes in a single service), `orchestrator` (Use this agent for any change that spans multiple services or requires cross-service coordination)\n- **Commands** (2): `cascade-init` (Initialize Cascade in the current project), `cascade-status` (Show the current state of Cascade orchestration)\n- **Hooks** (1): `hooks.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cascade@claude-community` from `alibrahim/cascade` (`plugins/cascade`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 5,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 2
  },
